{"category_edits":[{"category":"embedding_representation","rationale":"Normalize nonpadding item embeddings to unit L2 norm for sequence inputs and all target/candidate lookups, reducing embedding-norm disparities while preserving tied embeddings, dimension, input scaling, dot-product scoring, HSTU topology, loss and optimizer. The generated predictor imports HSTURec from train.py, so it uses the same normalization without checkpoint shape changes.","edits":[{"find":"class HSTURec(nn.Module):","replace":"class UnitNormItemEmbedding(nn.Embedding):
    def forward(self, items: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:
        embeddings = F.normalize(super().forward(items), p=2, dim=-1, eps=1e-12)
        return embeddings.masked_fill((items == 0).unsqueeze(-1), 0.0)


